{"id": "UgwpJ9A_69gxHZaOTXJ4AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 11, "text": "공기처럼 자연스럽게 스며드는 음악입니다. \n🎧 그냥 편하게 틀어두세요. \n  🎵Tracklist \n00:00 Tracing Your Name on the Rainy Glass  \n03:54 Whispers of Steam in an Empty Cafe  \n08:08 Cold Coffee and the Spring Rain  \n11:52 Midnight Jazz for a Heart Left Behind  \n15:55 Midnight Steam in an Empty Cup  \n19:56 Raindrops on the Window Pane  \n24:10 Echoes of Us in the Morning Mist  \n27:53 Silence Across the Table  \n32:16 Petals Falling on Our Last Table  \n36:05 Cold Coffee and Fading Shadows  \n40:24 Writing Your Name on the Wet Window \n44:12 Murmurs of Vapor in a Vacant Cafe \n48:32 Chilled Brew and the April Shower \n52:10 Late Night Jazz for a Broken Heart \n56:19 Late Night Mist in a Vacant Mug \n1:00:08 Rain Falling on the Glass Pane \n1:04:23 Our Lingering Echoes in the Dawn Fog \n1:08:08 Quiet Moments Across the Desk \n1:12:28 Scattered Petals on Our Final Table \n1:16:16 Chilled Coffee and Vanishing Shadows", "published": "2026-05-18T23:01:48", "replies": 1, "creator": true}
